      "Bestway 80v": {
        "activeVersion": "A711",
        "candidateVersion": "A715",
        "versions": [
          {
            "version": "A715",
            "channel": "candidate",
            "file": "firmware/4g-iot/bestway-80v/4g-iot_bestway-80v_A715.bin",
            "sha256": "B0093841F4E0D2A0CE5AFC915B8D9A512BE8DBC61C651E02DDE622E0BA939B5B",
            "size": 511456,
            "uploadedAt": "2026-10-02T09:33:25.000Z",
            "notes": "Bestway 80 V evidence-based current fix (A714 plus fix; capture retained). Purpose: make charge/discharge current visible on 80 V units. Maps field status words from 18 days of A711-A714 data (0x1141 charging +A; 0xC243/0xD143/0xC343 discharging -A; 0xD742/0x0642/0xC642 at full and 0xD343 idle: 0 A or -A). Validates the CRC-16/Modbus in bytes 36-37, stops comparing that CRC as a cycle count (CCC posted as 0), adds diag B7 for CRC rejects and keeps the real rejection reason. Assumptions are not yet confirmed by a labelled site capture. Candidate-only; not bench-validated."
          },
          {
            "version": "A714",
            "channel": "candidate",
            "file": "firmware/4g-iot/bestway-80v/4g-iot_bestway-80v_A714.bin",
            "sha256": "48B02D55F300C25E12F9E79B41AC3FE83DA4F1DFDC4B0ACD68783E822ABC9442",
            "size": 511200,
            "uploadedAt": "2026-10-02T09:01:56.000Z",
            "notes": "Bestway 80 V frame-capture diagnostic candidate (A713 plus capture). Purpose: identify the real current and cycle-count words. Both A7xx units report A:0.0 on every reading and a random CCC, while SOC cycles daily. Every SSPortal post carries the raw 38-byte BMS frame (fra/frr); every fifth post adds a passive census of all 5A A5 frames on the bus (fc/fx). Frame acceptance, posted values and the legacy request are unchanged from A713. Serial admin: frames, CAPTURE:ON/OFF. Adds about 90 KB/day while capture is on. Candidate-only; not bench-validated."
          },
          {
            "version": "A713",
            "channel": "candidate",
            "file": "firmware/4g-iot/bestway-80v/4g-iot_bestway-80v_A713.bin",
            "sha256": "982B78E51A345E4F1BA26811D481314A3FA0A036DB012AEBA9E3615D85736AC5",
            "size": 507936,
            "uploadedAt": "2026-09-16T08:02:50.742Z",
            "notes": "Bestway 80 V parser-reliability candidate: ignores diagnostic status-sign bytes for acceptance, rejects zero voltage/SOC/temperature, requires two agreeing frames, and permits only a zero-current unknown-status fallback with remote diagnostics. Candidate-only; bench validation is required before field deployment."
          },
          {
            "version": "A712",
            "channel": "candidate",
            "file": "firmware/4g-iot/bestway-80v/4g-iot_bestway-80v_A712.bin",
            "sha256": "99D1CE325B47D3954DFDA90F1DF434DA01FFB53EE337C830B57825CB2C3BA818",
            "size": 507072,
            "uploadedAt": "2026-09-09T17:31:41.419Z",
            "notes": "Version-only Bestway 80 V OTA proof target; otherwise identical to A711. Candidate-only; the Bestway OTA runbook bench gates remain required before any OTA proof or field use."
          },
